@startuml 003-buzz-answering-component
title 003 buzz-answering：組件圖

package "web" {
  [StudentPanel\n＋ AnswerForm（題組一次送出、送出後鎖定）] as Student
  [api.ts\nstudentSubmit(X-Team-Token)] as Api
}

package "server/quiz_server" {
  [app.py\nPOST /api/student/submit\nRequestValidationError 不回顯本體] as App
  [activity.Activity\nsubmit・clean_answers] as Act
  [scoring\nScoringRule・ClassicBuzzRule] as Scoring
  [results\nbuild（只在 ended 給學生）] as Results
  [views.student_view\n非 ended 只含本組] as Views
}

Student --> Api
Api --> App : 送出（只帶憑證、題號、答案）
App --> Act : team_of(token) 後 submit
Act --> Scoring : 排名一律經規則
App --> Views : 每連線 view
Views --> Results : 只有 phase == ended

note right of Views
  他組送出不改變本組 view，
  依 001 的送出迴圈不推送任何訊息
end note
@enduml
